# TEMPLATE ONLY. Install only under a fresh, exact WI75 claim after reviewing
# the complete effective sshd configuration and include order. Do not blindly
# append this as an early drop-in: a Match stanza scopes every later setting
# until the next Match, and may silently capture unrelated users.
# Put this account block last in the effective config (or use a validated
# explicit Match all reset where supported). Preserve all existing directives.
Match User scout-matepad-forward
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PubkeyAuthentication yes
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    AllowTcpForwarding remote
    PermitListen 127.0.0.1:18088
    PermitOpen none
    GatewayPorts no
    PermitTTY no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
    PermitTunnel no
    PermitUserRC no
    PermitUserEnvironment no
    MaxSessions 0
